  "description": "Now available to rent, this bright and well-presented 2-bedroom unfurnished apartment which comprises of a large open plan kitchen and dining room, two large bedrooms with ample storage and a spacious bathroom. Priorsgate is ideally located in the vibrant centre of Tallaght Village, offering convenience, space, and excellent local amenities right on your doorstep.\n\n*Parking is extra\n\nKey Features:\n\nSpacious open-plan living and dining area with plenty of natural light\n\nFully fitted kitchen with modern appliances\n\n2 x Double bedrooms with built-in wardrobes\n\nContemporary main bathroom with quality tiling and fittings\n\nPrivate balcony\n\nSecure entrance with intercom access\n\nLift access within the building\n\nPrime Location:\n\nSituated in the heart of Tallaght Village, this property is within walking distance of The Square Shopping Centre, Tallaght Hospital, TU Dublin - Tallaght Campus, and a wide range of shops, cafés, and restaurants. Excellent transport links include the Luas Red Line and multiple bus routes, with easy access to the M50.\n\nAs an I-RES resident, you can be assured of: \n- Reliable professional service, when you need it \n- Fully trained staff to support you at every stage \n- Own inhouse maintenance team \n- 24-hour on-call support for emergencies such as loss of heat, water or essential services \n- Clear communications and point of contact via our resident portal \n\nWe aim to reply to all emails as soon as possible, however as we receive a large number of enquiries, we may not be able to reply individually to all messages. If you do not hear from us within 48 hours, we regret that we are unable to assist you at this time. \n\n**Please note that the photos used in our marketing campaigns may vary from the actual apartment on offer.\n\nProspect Privacy Notice: Personal data you submit in the contact form is processed by I-RES according to applicable laws and our privacy statement https://www.iresreit.ie/IRES-REIT-Privacy",
